Based on upstream commit 38dfb1a22089d5b876be78f21a933970f66ef5cf.
The remaining changes are:

  storage/src/archive/prunable/{mod,storage}.rs
      Retire lookup references using only the index sections being pruned.

  storage/src/qmdb/sync/engine.rs
      Report reached targets before queued updates and observe finish requests
      received during the progress report.

  glue/src/dkg/reshare/application.rs
      Retry transient pending epoch information during boundary verification.

These patches do not change upstream request, response or storage encodings.
